{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a custom Shopify Liquid section inspired by the attached reference image.
    
    IMPORTANT: The reference image is only for the layout and UI structure. This section is NOT for seeds. It is a PRODUCT COLLECTION section specifically for POTS & PLANTERS.
    
    SECTION REQUIREMENTS:
    
    1. HEADER / TOP BAR
    - Add a clean horizontal top bar.
    - Left side: filter icon + "FILTER".
    - Right side: "Sort by" with a small dropdown arrow.
    - Keep the spacing, typography and minimal premium look similar to the reference.
    - Make the filter and sorting controls functional.
    
    2. SORT DROPDOWN
    When clicking "Sort by", show a dropdown containing:
    - Featured
    - Most relevant
    - Best selling
    - Alphabetically, A-Z
    - Alphabetically, Z-A
    - Price, low to high
    - Price, high to low
    - Date, old to new
    - Date, new to old
    
    Use Shopify's native collection sorting functionality where possible.
    
    3. PRODUCT GRID
    - Create a responsive 4-column product grid on desktop, similar to the reference.
    - 2 columns on tablet.
    - 2 columns or 1 column on mobile depending on screen width.
    - Use Shopify collection products dynamically.
    - This section should work with any Shopify collection assigned to it.
    
    4. PRODUCT CARD DESIGN
    Each product card should contain:
    - Large product image at the top.
    - Rounded corners on the image.
    - Optional discount badge in the top-right corner, such as "32% OFF".
    - Product rating badge near the bottom of the image.
    - Product name below the image.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough when a discount exists.
    - A dark green rounded "View Product" button aligned toward the right.
    - Maintain a clean white product information area.
    - Use subtle spacing and rounded corners similar to the reference.
    
    5. POT / PLANTER PRODUCT CONTENT
    This section is specifically for products such as:
    - Ceramic Pots
    - Terracotta Pots
    - Decorative Pots
    - Indoor Plant Pots
    - Outdoor Plant Pots
    - Hanging Planters
    - Self-Watering Pots
    - Plastic Pots
    - Cement Pots
    - Designer Planters
    - Plant Stands with Pots
    
    Do NOT use seed-related terminology, seed packets, seed categories or seed-specific content anywhere in the section.
    
    6. PRODUCT IMAGE HANDLING
    - Use the actual Shopify product images dynamically.
    - Do not generate placeholder seed images.
    - Product images should maintain their original aspect ratio while fitting neatly inside a consistent image area.
    - Use object-fit: cover where appropriate.
    - Do not crop important parts of the pot unnecessarily.
    
    7. FILTER
    Create a functional filter interface using Shopify's collection filtering system where available.
    Potential filters:
    - Pot Type
    - Material
    - Size
    - Colour
    - Price
    - Indoor / Outdoor
    - Availability
    
    Use Shopify's existing product filters dynamically instead of hardcoding values where possible.
    
    8. DESIGN STYLE
    - Premium modern gardening / nursery website aesthetic.
    - Clean and minimal.
    - Soft off-white / very light warm background.
    - Dark green typography and buttons.
    - Rounded product cards.
    - Elegant serif or premium-looking font for product names.
    - Clean sans-serif font for prices, buttons and controls.
    - Plenty of whitespace.
    - Smooth hover effects.
    
    9. HOVER EFFECT
    On product-card hover:
    - Slight image zoom.
    - Very subtle card elevation/shadow.
    - Button should have a smooth hover transition.
    - Keep the animation elegant and fast, not excessive.
    
    10. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    Make the entire section fully responsive for:
    - Desktop
    - Tablet
    - Mobile
    
    On mobile:
    - Keep the filter and sort controls easy to use.
    - Product cards should remain compact.
    - Product images should have consistent proportions.
    - Buttons and text must not overflow.
    
    11. SHOPIFY COMPATIBILITY
    - Write this as a complete Shopify Liquid section.
    - Include schema settings so the merchant can customize:
      - Section heading
      - Products per page
      - Number of columns
      - Show rating
      - Show discount badge
      - Show filter
      - Show sorting
      - Button text
      - Colors
      - Border radius
    - Use Shopify Liquid objects and collection/product data wherever possible.
    - Do not use external libraries.
    - Keep CSS and JavaScript self-contained inside the section.
    - Make sure the code can be pasted directly into a new Shopify section file.
    
    12. HEADING
    Use this heading above the product collection:
    "Find Your Perfect Pot"
    
    The final result should visually follow the overall structure of the attached reference image, but the content, products and styling should clearly represent a premium POTS & PLANTERS collection rather than seeds.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign selected_collection = block.settings.collection %}
{% if selected_collection == blank %}{% assign selected_collection = collection %}{% endif %}
{% assign sort_value = selected_collection.sort_by | default: selected_collection.default_sort_by %}

{% style %}
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: block; width: 100%; background: {{ block.settings.background_color }}; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width: {{ settings.page_width | default: 1200 }}px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 64px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin: 0 0 30px; color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 52px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 16px 0; border-top: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toolbar form { margin: 0; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; font: 600 12px/1.2 Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; background: none; border: 0; padding: 8px 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sort { position: relative; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sort select { appearance: none; border: 0; background: transparent; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; cursor: pointer; font: 600 12px Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 8px 22px 8px 8px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sort:after { content: ''; position: absolute; right: 2px; top: 50%; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-right: 1px solid currentColor; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; transform: translateY(-70%) rotate(45deg); pointer-events: none; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0fr 1fr; gap: 0; transition: grid-template-columns .2s ease; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout.is-open { grid-template-columns: minmax(210px, 250px) 1fr; gap: 28px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filters { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout:not(.is-open) .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filters { visibility: hidden; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-group { border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; padding: 0 0 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-group summary { cursor: pointer; font: 600 12px Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-options { display: grid; gap: 9px; padding-top: 13px; font: 14px Arial, sans-serif; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-options label { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 20px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-actions button { border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.text_color }}; border-radius: 999px; padding: 9px 13px; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.columns_desktop }}, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px 18px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { min-width: 0; transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease; border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_radius }}px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(13,58,29,.08); }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media { position: relative; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.08; border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_radius }}px; background: {{ block.settings.image_background }}; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; object-fit: contain; transition: transform .25s ease; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge { position: absolute; right: 10px; top: 10px; z-index: 1; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 9px; background: {{ block.settings.badge_color }}; color: #fff; font: 700 10px Arial, sans-serif; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating { position: absolute; left: 10px; bottom: 10px; padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.94); color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; font: 600 11px Arial, sans-serif; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info { padding: 14px 2px 0; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name { display: block; color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font: 500 18px/1.25 Georgia, serif; text-decoration: none; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; font: 600 14px Arial, sans-serif; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare { color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; text-decoration: line-through; font-weight: 400; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 12px; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { display: inline-block; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 15px; background: {{ block.settings.button_color }}; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font: 600 12px Arial, sans-serif; transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:hover { background: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }}; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty { padding: 50px 0; text-align: center; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; }
  @media (max-width: 989px) { .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; padding: 32px 16px 44px; } .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toolbar { margin-bottom: 20px; } .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout.is-open { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout.is-open .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filters { padding-bottom: 18px; } .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.columns_mobile }}, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 22px 12px; } .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name { font-size: 16px; } .ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { padding: 9px 11px; font-size: 11px; } }
{% endstyle %}

<pots-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <h2 class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    <div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toolbar">
      {% if block.settings.show_filter and selected_collection.filters != empty %}
        <button class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control" type="button" data-filter-toggle aria-expanded="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 6h16M7 12h10M10 18h4"/></svg>Filter</button>
      {% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.show_sorting %}
        <form class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sort" method="get" action="{{ selected_collection.url }}">
          <label for="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control">Sort by</label>
          <select id="sort-{{ ai_gen_id }}" name="sort_by" onchange="this.form.submit()">
            {% for option in selected_collection.sort_options %}<option value="{{ option.value | escape }}" {% if option.value == sort_value %}selected{% endif %}>{{ option.name }}</option>{% endfor %}
          </select>
        </form>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout" data-layout>
      {% if block.settings.show_filter and selected_collection.filters != empty %}
        <aside class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filters">
          <form method="get" action="{{ selected_collection.url }}">
            {% for filter in selected_collection.filters %}
              <details class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-group"><summary>{{ filter.label }}</summary><div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-options">
                {% case filter.type %}{% when 'list' %}{% for value in filter.values %}<label><input type="checkbox" name="{{ value.param_name }}" value="{{ value.value }}" {% if value.active %}checked{% endif %} {% if value.count == 0 and value.active == false %}disabled{% endif %}>{{ value.label }} ({{ value.count }})</label>{% endfor %}{% when 'price_range' %}<label>From <input type="number" name="{{ filter.min_value.param_name }}" value="{{ filter.min_value.value | default: '' }}" min="0" placeholder="0"></label><label>To <input type="number" name="{{ filter.max_value.param_name }}" value="{{ filter.max_value.value | default: '' }}" min="0" placeholder="Any"></label>{% endcase %}
              </div></details>
            {% endfor %}
            <div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__filter-actions"><button type="submit">Apply filters</button><a href="{{ selected_collection.url }}">Clear</a></div>
          </form>
        </aside>
      {% endif %}
      <div>
        {% paginate selected_collection.products by block.settings.products_per_page %}
          {% if selected_collection.products.size > 0 %}<div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">
            {% for product in selected_collection.products %}
              {% assign first_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}
              {% assign discount = first_variant.compare_at_price | minus: first_variant.price | times: 100 | divided_by: first_variant.compare_at_price | round %}
              <article class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">
                <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">{% if product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}">{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_discount and first_variant.compare_at_price > first_variant.price %}<span class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ discount }}% off</span>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_rating and product.metafields.reviews.rating.value != blank %}<span class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">★ {{ product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating | round: 1 }}</span>{% endif %}</a>
                <div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info"><a class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name" href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title | escape }}</a><div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ first_variant.price | money }}{% if first_variant.compare_at_price > first_variant.price %}<span class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ first_variant.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions"><a class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" href="{{ product.url }}">{{ block.settings.button_text | escape }}</a></div></div>
              </article>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>{% else %}<div class="ai-pots-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">No pots or planters match these filters.</div>{% endif %}
        {% endpaginate %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</pots-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function(){
  class PotsCollection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement { connectedCallback(){ const toggle=this.querySelector('[data-filter-toggle]'); const layout=this.querySelector('[data-layout]'); if(toggle){ toggle.addEventListener('click',function(){ const open=layout.classList.toggle('is-open'); toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',open); }); } } }
  if(!customElements.get('pots-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}')) customElements.define('pots-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}',PotsCollection{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Pots collection",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"collection","id":"collection","label":"Collection"},
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Find Your Perfect Pot"},
    {"type":"range","id":"products_per_page","label":"Products per page","min":4,"max":24,"step":4,"default":12},
    {"type":"select","id":"columns_desktop","label":"Desktop columns","options":[{"value":"3","label":"3"},{"value":"4","label":"4"}],"default":"4"},
    {"type":"select","id":"columns_mobile","label":"Mobile columns","options":[{"value":"1","label":"1"},{"value":"2","label":"2"}],"default":"2"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_rating","label":"Show rating","default":true},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_discount","label":"Show discount badge","default":true},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_filter","label":"Show filter","default":true},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_sorting","label":"Show sorting","default":true},
    {"type":"text","id":"button_text","label":"Button text","default":"View product"},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"range","id":"card_radius","label":"Card radius","min":0,"max":32,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":16},
    {"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#f8f4ec"},
    {"type":"color","id":"image_background","label":"Image background","default":"#f4f7dc"},
    {"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Heading","default":"#0d3a1d"},
    {"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#14231a"},
    {"type":"color","id":"muted_color","label":"Muted text","default":"#5b6660"},
    {"type":"color","id":"border_color","label":"Borders","default":"#d9ded3"},
    {"type":"color","id":"button_color","label":"Button","default":"#0d3a1d"},
    {"type":"color","id":"button_hover_color","label":"Button hover","default":"#1f5130"},
    {"type":"color","id":"badge_color","label":"Discount badge","default":"#0d3a1d"}
  ],
  "presets": [{"name":"Pots collection"}],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "pots-collection-block"
}
{% endschema %}